Error [jet.DependencyAuthorityExceeded]: `email` function `crypto.seal` uses the `Rand` effect, which this package's budget doesn't allow
  --> /workspace/deps/email/src/crypto.jet:2:1
    |
  2 | seal: fn() {}
    | ^^^^
 Why: An `authority` budget fails the build when package code or any dependency reaches an effect you didn't list — supply-chain review as a compile error
 Fix: Add `Rand` to `authority.allow`, grant it to `email` in `authority.grants`, or drop the dependency
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1220
